= iii
{parent=b}
{scope}

= Solution
{parent=iii}

By the definition of the <trace-class operator>[trace norm] and positivity of $|T|$,
$$
\|T\|_1
=\bigl\||T|^{1/2}\bigr\|_2^2
=\sum_n\bigl\||T|^{1/2}e_n\bigr\|^2
=\sum_n\langle|T|e_n,e_n\rangle.
$$

